WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.966 --> 00:00:10.900
So nice. No early Rhyhorn Race practice for me.

2
00:00:10.966 --> 00:00:12.966
And no Fletchling waking me up.

3
00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:15.833
Such a relaxing way to start the day.

4
00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:24.466
- Fennekin, did you get enough?
- Fennekin.

5
00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:27.299
I did too. Okay.

6
00:00:27.366 --> 00:00:29.366
Mm-mm. Mm!

7
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.699
Thank you for everything.

8
00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.766
- Let’s go.
- Mm.

9
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:36.699
Santalune City’s really close.

10
00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:40.433
Just a little bit further and I'll finally get to see him.

11
00:00:43.699 --> 00:00:46.166
Our heroes have arrived in Santalune City

12
00:00:46.233 --> 00:00:50.933
and soon Ash will be challenging his first Gym in the Kalos region.

13
00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:54.833
Yeah. Santalune Gym, you’d better look out.

14
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.500
I’m going to get my first Kalos badge from you.

15
00:00:57.566 --> 00:00:59.533
Pika.

16
00:00:59.599 --> 00:01:02.599
Come on, guys, can’t you slow down a little?

17
00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:04.000
- Ah!
- Huh?

18
00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:07.433
- Hey, Clemont, hurry up.
- One thing.

19
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.500
And I think it’s kind of important.

20
00:01:09.566 --> 00:01:13.433
Do you have any idea where the Santalune Gym might be located?

21
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.399
- No clue. Course I don’t.
- Huh?

22
00:01:17.866 --> 00:01:20.166
I figure stuff out best when I run.

23
00:01:20.233 --> 00:01:22.666
Keep moving ahead and you can’t go wrong.

24
00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:26.033
- That’s the way we roll.
- Pikachu.

25
00:01:27.233 --> 00:01:28.399
Huh?

26
00:01:28.466 --> 00:01:31.833
- Pika.
- Thanks so much for the great pic.

27
00:01:33.633 --> 00:01:36.233
The two of you seem to have the makings of a great team.

28
00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.899
Hey, thanks. Pikachu's my partner.

29
00:01:38.966 --> 00:01:40.899
Pikachu.

30
00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:43.433
F.Y.I., if you’re going to the Santalune Gym,

31
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.233
make a right at that corner.

32
00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.300
Yeah? Awesome! Thanks a lot for the info.

33
00:01:48.366 --> 00:01:50.199
I told you we can’t go wrong.

34
00:01:50.266 --> 00:01:52.633
- Let's move, Pikachu.
- Pika.

35
00:01:52.699 --> 00:01:55.466
- Uh, Ash, not so fast! Uh! Uh!
- Hey, wait up.

36
00:01:56.699 --> 00:01:58.699
Thank you for your assistance.

37
00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:05.866
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

38
00:02:05.933 --> 00:02:09.600
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

39
00:02:09.666 --> 00:02:12.133
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

40
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

41
00:02:15.299 --> 00:02:18.333
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

42
00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.533
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

43
00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:24.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

44
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

45
00:02:27.433 --> 00:02:29.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

46
00:02:29.933 --> 00:02:32.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon ♪

47
00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:44.400
Wow, we made it.

48
00:02:44.466 --> 00:02:47.100
Now, if I remember my facts correctly,

49
00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:50.299
the Santalune Gym Leader specializes in Bug-type Pokémon.

50
00:02:50.366 --> 00:02:52.900
I can’t wait to go inside. It’s going to be fun.

51
00:02:52.966 --> 00:02:55.500
-Hello in there.

52
00:02:55.566 --> 00:02:58.266
I want to challenge you to a battle.

53
00:02:58.333 --> 00:02:59.433
Wheee!

54
00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.400
Argh!

55
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.900
- Huh. It’s Helioptile.
- Pika.

56
00:03:05.966 --> 00:03:09.266
Welcome, Ash, Pikachu.

57
00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:10.700
Huh?

58
00:03:10.766 --> 00:03:14.433
- It’s nice to see you both again.
- Hey, Alexa.

59
00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.466
- I didn’t know you were here.
- Uh-huh.

60
00:03:16.533 --> 00:03:20.200
I finished up my reporting and thought you’d be here soon, so I waited.

61
00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:24.600
- So are these your new friends?
- Yup. I met them in Lumiose City.

62
00:03:24.666 --> 00:03:28.166
Hi, Alexa. My name’s Bonnie and this is Dedenne.

63
00:03:29.399 --> 00:03:32.100
- And this is my brother.
- I’m Clemont.

64
00:03:32.166 --> 00:03:34.766
It’s nice to meet you. That’s quite amazing.

65
00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:37.433
- You already knew the Gym Leader.
- She’s not the Leader.

66
00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.100
See, Alexa’s actually a Pokémon journalist.

67
00:03:40.166 --> 00:03:43.299
That’s right. The Gym Leader’s my younger sister, Viola.

68
00:03:43.366 --> 00:03:45.399
- Viola?
- That’s me.

69
00:03:45.466 --> 00:03:47.466
Huh?

70
00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:54.500
- Nice to see you again.
- Ah! You mean you’re Alexa’s sister?

71
00:03:54.566 --> 00:03:55.833
Pika. -Oh!

72
00:03:55.899 --> 00:03:58.433
So I take it you’ve already met one another?

73
00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.066
Right. At the fountain. I took a picture of Pikachu and Ash.

74
00:04:02.133 --> 00:04:04.733
Alexa said you wanted to challenge me while I was gone.

75
00:04:04.799 --> 00:04:09.200
- I still do. How about it?
- Sure. Please, come inside.

76
00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:14.500
Wow. You took all of these pictures, Viola?

77
00:04:14.566 --> 00:04:17.899
Uh-huh. Although, these are just a few of the pictures I’ve taken.

78
00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:20.966
She’s got quite a talent for photographing Bug types.

79
00:04:21.033 --> 00:04:24.000
She even helps me out with my reporting from time to time.

80
00:04:24.066 --> 00:04:25.800
This is great work.

81
00:04:25.866 --> 00:04:28.400
It really captures the love you have for your subjects.

82
00:04:28.466 --> 00:04:31.833
Sure does. You can see how much you care about Bug types.

83
00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:35.500
-I know. Viola, you’re a keeper!

84
00:04:37.233 --> 00:04:40.733
I mean, please take care of my brother.

85
00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.000
Uh...

86
00:04:42.066 --> 00:04:45.233
- We’re a little bit confused.
- Pika.

87
00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:48.200
Bonnie, I told you to stop this a million times.

88
00:04:48.266 --> 00:04:50.800
You know you need somebody to take care of you.

89
00:04:50.866 --> 00:04:53.533
I think Viola would make you a nice wife.

90
00:04:53.599 --> 00:04:58.000
- A nice wife?
- Uh, no! This is so embarrassing.

91
00:04:58.066 --> 00:05:00.500
Activating Aipom Arm!

92
00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:02.300
Huh?

93
00:05:02.366 --> 00:05:05.200
Would you please just mind your own business?

94
00:05:05.266 --> 00:05:07.733
I hope you’ll think about it, please, Viola?

95
00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:08.933
Uh...

96
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.733
Such a unique little girl.

97
00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:14.733
So shall we, Ash? How about that battle?

98
00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.233
- Great.
- Pika.

99
00:05:19.333 --> 00:05:22.666
He’s going to be so surprised after all this time.

100
00:05:24.766 --> 00:05:28.200
I wonder how he’ll react when he sees me?

101
00:05:28.266 --> 00:05:30.566
I can’t wait to find out.

102
00:05:35.133 --> 00:05:38.133
The Gym Battle between Ash, the challenger, and Viola,

103
00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:41.300
the Santalune Gym Leader, will now begin.

104
00:05:41.366 --> 00:05:43.966
Each side will have the use of two Pokémon

105
00:05:44.033 --> 00:05:47.800
and the battle will be over when either Trainer’s Pokémon are unable to continue.

106
00:05:47.866 --> 00:05:51.800
Only the challenger may substitute Pokémon.

107
00:05:51.866 --> 00:05:56.800
My lens is always focused on victory, no matter what. Surskit, go.

108
00:05:59.099 --> 00:06:01.233
- Surskit!
- A Surskit, huh?

109
00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.500
Surskit, the Pond Skater Pokémon.

110
00:06:05.566 --> 00:06:08.466
Surskit can walk on water as if it was skating.

111
00:06:08.533 --> 00:06:11.233
It attracts prey with the sweet aroma it produces.

112
00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:16.166
My first Kalos Gym battle and I’m going to start it off with Pikachu.

113
00:06:16.233 --> 00:06:17.966
Ash’s using Pikachu.

114
00:06:18.033 --> 00:06:20.966
That’s because Pikachu’s got a big advantage over Surskit,

115
00:06:21.033 --> 00:06:22.666
who’s a Bug- and Water-type.

116
00:06:22.733 --> 00:06:25.433
Now, battle begin.

117
00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.766
Pikachu, let’s start this with Quick Attack.

118
00:06:32.833 --> 00:06:35.266
Attack!

119
00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:37.799
Quick, Surskit, use Protect.

120
00:06:41.633 --> 00:06:44.566
Go around Surskit and use Iron Tail.

121
00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.966
Surskit, dodge it!

122
00:06:48.033 --> 00:06:51.166
Ah! Pikachu!

123
00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:58.933
Focus, Pikachu. Use Electro Ball and stop Surskit.

124
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.066
Pikachu!

125
00:07:03.333 --> 00:07:05.099
Surskit, use Ice Beam.

126
00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:13.233
-My sister’s very strong.

127
00:07:13.299 --> 00:07:15.066
Huh.

128
00:07:15.133 --> 00:07:17.799
Defeating her is no easy task.

129
00:07:17.866 --> 00:07:21.533
This is where it begins. Use Ice Beam on the field.

130
00:07:23.599 --> 00:07:26.966
Pika!

131
00:07:27.033 --> 00:07:30.133
Pika! Pika!

132
00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.933
Ah!

133
00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.533
Oh. The battlefield’s frozen.

134
00:07:35.599 --> 00:07:40.266
Pikachu! Pika...

135
00:07:40.333 --> 00:07:42.633
Ah! Pikachu, get up, quick!

136
00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:44.933
Pika! Pika!

137
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.799
Our ice battlefield’s picture-perfect. Surskit, let’s go.

138
00:07:48.866 --> 00:07:50.866
Surskit!

139
00:07:55.366 --> 00:07:58.733
- Hang in there. Use Iron Tail.
- Pika!

140
00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:08.333
Pull it together, Surskit! and use Ice Beam.

141
00:08:09.466 --> 00:08:15.133
- Now, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!
- Pikachu!

142
00:08:18.533 --> 00:08:20.533
- Pikachu, no!
- Yes.

143
00:08:20.599 --> 00:08:23.299
Now use your picture-perfect Signal Beam.

144
00:08:28.866 --> 00:08:30.233
Pikachu!

145
00:08:34.966 --> 00:08:38.666
Pikachu is unable to battle. Surskit wins.

146
00:08:38.733 --> 00:08:44.233
Pikachu. You okay? Pikachu?

147
00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.933
Pika. Pikachu

148
00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.533
You were great out there.

149
00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:49.933
Thanks, buddy.

150
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.699
You trained Pikachu quite well, but it still has a long way to go

151
00:08:53.766 --> 00:08:56.300
before it can beat my Surskit.

152
00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:03.133
I’ll beat it now, with this Pokémon. Fletchling, let’s go.

153
00:09:06.366 --> 00:09:08.100
Wow, Fletchling’ll be great.

154
00:09:08.166 --> 00:09:11.100
It can attack from above, so the frozen ground won’t do a thing.

155
00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:15.800
A Flying type like Fletchling has an advantage over Surskit too.

156
00:09:15.866 --> 00:09:17.800
Um, uh...

157
00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.366
There he is. It’s Ash.

158
00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.866
Can I help you?

159
00:09:26.933 --> 00:09:31.566
Uh... I was kind of wondering if it would be okay if I watched them battle.

160
00:09:31.633 --> 00:09:34.333
Of course, that would be just fine. Welcome.

161
00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.566
- Why don’t you join us over here?
- Yeah. It’s getting real good.

162
00:09:37.633 --> 00:09:39.566
That’s so nice of you. Thanks.

163
00:09:39.633 --> 00:09:41.800
Okay, Fletchling, Peck, let’s go.

164
00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.833
Quick, dodge it.

165
00:09:49.133 --> 00:09:52.199
Now, use Ice Beam!

166
00:09:52.266 --> 00:09:54.066
Dodge it!

167
00:09:54.133 --> 00:09:56.300
- Awesome.
- Yeah. Go for it, Fletchling!

168
00:09:56.366 --> 00:10:00.033
- Surskit, Sticky Web, go.
- Fletchling, Double Team.

169
00:10:07.266 --> 00:10:08.633
It dodged everything.

170
00:10:08.699 --> 00:10:11.300
All right, attack, attack, attack, attack!

171
00:10:11.366 --> 00:10:16.133
Now, Fletchling, use Razor Wind!

172
00:10:16.199 --> 00:10:18.366
Surskit

173
00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:23.866
Surskit is unable to battle. Fletchling wins.

174
00:10:23.933 --> 00:10:28.866
All right!

175
00:10:28.933 --> 00:10:31.400
All right!

176
00:10:31.466 --> 00:10:34.066
Did you see how totally awesome Ash battles?

177
00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:35.800
Mm-hm. I sure did.

178
00:10:35.866 --> 00:10:40.566
Now both sides have one Pokémon left. Ash just might win this.

179
00:10:41.966 --> 00:10:45.100
Surskit, you were great. You deserve a good rest.

180
00:10:45.166 --> 00:10:48.300
Time to beat your other Pokémon and get my hands on

181
00:10:48.366 --> 00:10:52.033
- my first Kalos Gym Badge.
- It’s not going to be that easy.

182
00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:55.600
My Gym Leader pride’s on the line. Let’s do this, Vivillon.

183
00:10:57.833 --> 00:11:01.266
Vivillon!

184
00:11:01.333 --> 00:11:02.433
Huh?

185
00:11:07.066 --> 00:11:09.933
Who’s that Pokémon?

186
00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.166
It’s Vivillon.

187
00:11:20.933 --> 00:11:22.933
Who’s that Pokémon?

188
00:11:25.633 --> 00:11:27.933
Vivillon, the Scale Pokémon.

189
00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.333
Vivillon are skillfully able to find a source of water.

190
00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:35.500
It has been said that you’ll find a spring if you follow a Vivillon.

191
00:11:35.566 --> 00:11:37.733
All right, Fletchling, Peck.

192
00:11:42.366 --> 00:11:45.699
See? Flying-type moves are super effective against Vivillon.

193
00:11:47.266 --> 00:11:49.199
Vivillon, use Psychic!

194
00:11:54.233 --> 00:11:56.366
Ah! What happened?

195
00:11:56.433 --> 00:11:58.333
Since I made an ice battlefield,

196
00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.566
I want you to experience what it’s all about.

197
00:12:04.133 --> 00:12:05.500
Fletchling!

198
00:12:06.666 --> 00:12:10.033
Fletchling, you okay? Can you still fly?

199
00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:11.766
Fletch! Fletch! Fletchling!

200
00:12:11.833 --> 00:12:14.666
All right. Use Gust!

201
00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:23.000
- Fletchling!
- It’s stuck in that Sticky Web.

202
00:12:23.066 --> 00:12:26.566
- Oh, no!
- Break free! You can do it, Fletchling!

203
00:12:30.199 --> 00:12:33.000
A picture-perfect opportunity.

204
00:12:33.066 --> 00:12:35.666
Vivillon, Solar Beam!

205
00:12:35.733 --> 00:12:37.633
Vivillon!

206
00:12:45.699 --> 00:12:48.400
Oh, no, Fletchling.

207
00:12:50.966 --> 00:12:54.233
Oh. Fletchling!

208
00:12:56.133 --> 00:12:58.433
Fletchling...

209
00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.466
Fletchling is unable to battle.

210
00:13:00.533 --> 00:13:04.033
Vivillon wins, which means the victor is Viola, the Gym Leader.

211
00:13:07.466 --> 00:13:11.633
- Thanks a lot, Vivillon.
- Fletchling!

212
00:13:11.699 --> 00:13:13.866
- Are you okay?
- Ling.

213
00:13:13.933 --> 00:13:16.533
Ash!

214
00:13:18.066 --> 00:13:20.599
We need to get them both to the Pokémon Center.

215
00:13:20.666 --> 00:13:23.199
I'm afraid that battle put them through a lot.

216
00:13:23.266 --> 00:13:26.699
- Fletch!
- Pika...

217
00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:37.699
I know I lost, but I’ll come back here stronger.

218
00:13:37.766 --> 00:13:40.699
When I do, I hope you’ll let me have a rematch.

219
00:13:40.766 --> 00:13:44.199
I’ll be looking forward to it. Come back anytime.

220
00:13:44.266 --> 00:13:47.933
Let’s go.

221
00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:54.633
Uh... Oh... Uh...

222
00:13:54.699 --> 00:13:57.833
Oh!

223
00:13:58.833 --> 00:14:02.033
Mm? Ah! Is that...

224
00:14:03.933 --> 00:14:06.699
Nurse Joy, please take care of my Pokémon.

225
00:14:10.933 --> 00:14:14.599
Don’t worry, Ash. They’ll be all better in no time.

226
00:14:18.433 --> 00:14:21.300
So that’s the photo you took when they were on their way here?

227
00:14:21.366 --> 00:14:24.500
- That’s right. Isn’t it a great shot?
- Excellent.

228
00:14:24.566 --> 00:14:28.666
You can really pick up the powerful bond Ash and Pikachu have with each other.

229
00:14:29.866 --> 00:14:34.266
You’re right, although their battling wasn’t all that powerful.

230
00:14:34.333 --> 00:14:36.133
Don’t underestimate them.

231
00:14:36.199 --> 00:14:38.733
I wouldn’t be surprised if things are quite different

232
00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.133
the next time you battle him.

233
00:14:40.199 --> 00:14:42.500
- Huh?
- That’s the kind of Trainer Ash is.

234
00:14:42.566 --> 00:14:45.933
I think I’m going out for a little while.

235
00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.066
But... where are you going?

236
00:14:49.066 --> 00:14:50.433
Huh?

237
00:15:00.066 --> 00:15:01.566
Here, eat up.

238
00:15:04.566 --> 00:15:07.733
Oh, Dedenne, you’re such a cutie pie.

239
00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:10.099
It must have been really hungry.

240
00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:21.733
Viola totally beat me. Man, is she strong.

241
00:15:41.666 --> 00:15:43.466
Uh...

242
00:15:46.833 --> 00:15:50.333
Pikachu and Fletchling weren’t able to show their strengths at all.

243
00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:53.000
If that’s the way it’s going to be, I can’t win,

244
00:15:53.066 --> 00:15:56.500
no matter how many times I try. What do I do?

245
00:15:56.566 --> 00:15:59.033
- Uh...
- Huh?

246
00:15:59.099 --> 00:16:01.666
Excuse me. I think this is yours.

247
00:16:01.733 --> 00:16:05.566
Uh? Huh? Guess I forgot it. Hey, thanks a lot.

248
00:16:05.633 --> 00:16:08.966
- Wow. You’re that girl from before.
- Before?

249
00:16:09.033 --> 00:16:11.333
She was standing with us during your battle.

250
00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.333
My name’s Bonnie and this is my big brother.

251
00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:17.533
- I’m Clemont.
- And say hello to Dedenne.

252
00:16:17.599 --> 00:16:20.066
- Nice to meet you.

253
00:16:20.133 --> 00:16:22.133
What do you know? Sorry.

254
00:16:22.199 --> 00:16:24.699
I was so busy battling, I didn’t see you there.

255
00:16:24.766 --> 00:16:27.300
- Oh, that’s okay.
- My name is Ash.

256
00:16:27.366 --> 00:16:31.566
Yeah, I know. Serena’s my name. Do you remember...

257
00:16:31.633 --> 00:16:33.300
-Huh?

258
00:16:33.366 --> 00:16:36.300
Huh?

259
00:16:36.366 --> 00:16:37.833
Thank you for waiting.

260
00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:42.300
Your Pikachu and Fletchling are now fully recovered and feeling fine.

261
00:16:42.366 --> 00:16:43.566
Pika!

262
00:16:48.366 --> 00:16:53.433
- That’s great. Thank you, Nurse Joy.
- It’s my pleasure.

263
00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:55.966
Fletchling and Pikachu, this is Serena.

264
00:16:56.033 --> 00:16:58.733
She was with Clemont and Bonnie watching us battle.

265
00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:01.166
- Pika. Pika.
- Fletch. Fletch. Fletchling.

266
00:17:01.233 --> 00:17:04.133
Hi, you two. Nice to meet you.

267
00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:06.666
Uh, I just realized something.

268
00:17:06.733 --> 00:17:09.033
Nurse Joy, how did you get to the Pokémon Center

269
00:17:09.099 --> 00:17:11.866
from Route 4 without passing me? 0Huh?

270
00:17:11.933 --> 00:17:14.266
But is that the Nurse Joy you met on Route 4?

271
00:17:14.333 --> 00:17:18.500
Couldn’t be. I would think the Nurse Joy you met on Route 4 was my cousin.

272
00:17:18.566 --> 00:17:21.000
- Your cousin?
- I knew it.

273
00:17:21.066 --> 00:17:23.200
Here’s a photo of me and my cousins

274
00:17:23.266 --> 00:17:25.733
during the Kalos region’s nursing workshop.

275
00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:29.466
- Wow, it’s the same in Kalos, too!
- Incredible.

276
00:17:29.533 --> 00:17:32.733
Oh, right. I was hoping you’d look at my Pokémon, too.

277
00:17:34.866 --> 00:17:36.233
Fennekin!

278
00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:38.733
Whoa. Never seen that Pokémon.

279
00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:42.800
Fennekin, the Fox Pokémon.

280
00:17:42.866 --> 00:17:46.833
Fennekin expels hot air that can reach nearly 400 degrees.

281
00:17:46.899 --> 00:17:49.300
It likes to snack on twigs.

282
00:17:49.366 --> 00:17:53.100
- I guess it’s a Fire-type Pokémon, right?
- And it’s so cute.

283
00:17:53.166 --> 00:17:55.466
Yeah. I got it from Professor Sycamore.

284
00:17:55.533 --> 00:17:56.800
Professor Sycamore, huh?

285
00:17:56.866 --> 00:18:01.133
You see Fennekin is one of three Pokémon that new Trainers may choose from.

286
00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:04.866
Therefore, I can deduce that you’re a new Trainer.

287
00:18:04.933 --> 00:18:07.366
Right! I just started my journey.

288
00:18:07.433 --> 00:18:09.600
I’ll be glad to look at Fennekin.

289
00:18:09.666 --> 00:18:12.666
Please wait right here while I perform a thorough exam.

290
00:18:14.133 --> 00:18:16.133
Thank you, Nurse Joy.

291
00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:18.100
- Ash?
- Huh?

292
00:18:18.166 --> 00:18:19.533
Alexa.

293
00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:22.733
It looks like Pikachu and Fletchling are fully recovered.

294
00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:25.933
Let me guess, you’re going to start training right away.

295
00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.333
Of course I am.

296
00:18:27.399 --> 00:18:30.166
- Do you want to help me out?
- Pika! Pikachu!

297
00:18:33.633 --> 00:18:39.300
You see, Noivern can use Gust too. Noivern, let’s go!

298
00:18:40.666 --> 00:18:42.500
Noivern! Noivern!

299
00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.333
Noi!

300
00:18:46.733 --> 00:18:51.066
One of our problems with Viola was we couldn’t get past Vivillon’s Gust.

301
00:18:51.133 --> 00:18:55.233
So let’s try to keep our balance. Pikachu, Fletchling, heads up!

302
00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:57.033
- Pikachu!
- Ling!

303
00:18:57.100 --> 00:19:01.766
- Go ahead, Alexa.
- Here it comes. Noivern, use Gust.

304
00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:06.800
- Pikachu!
- Fledgling!

305
00:19:06.866 --> 00:19:09.866
Hang in there, Pikachu! Be strong, Fletchling!

306
00:19:13.466 --> 00:19:16.966
Pikachu! Fletchling!

307
00:19:18.033 --> 00:19:20.333
You okay?

308
00:19:20.399 --> 00:19:22.533
- Fletch! Fletchling!
- Pi... Pika!

309
00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.600
I’m here for you two.

310
00:19:24.666 --> 00:19:26.966
So don’t worry and concentrate on training.

311
00:19:27.033 --> 00:19:29.466
- Fletchling! Fletch! Fletch!
- Pika! Pika!

312
00:19:30.466 --> 00:19:32.466
Have Noivern use Gust again, please.

313
00:19:32.533 --> 00:19:34.533
All right, but get ready!

314
00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:37.300
Noivern, use Gust.

315
00:19:37.366 --> 00:19:40.200
Pika!

316
00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.166
We’ve got to be able to deal with Gust.

317
00:19:44.233 --> 00:19:47.166
- Fletch! Fletch! Fletchling!
- Pikachu!

318
00:19:47.233 --> 00:19:48.533
You’re both doing great.

319
00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.899
I know you can do it.

320
00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.600
Ah!

321
00:19:55.666 --> 00:19:57.500
- Oh!
- Ash, oh, no.

322
00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.633
Vivillon’s Gust isn’t the only thing we have to deal with.

323
00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.233
There’s Surskit’s Ice Beam and Sticky Web, too.

324
00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:09.000
How are we going to do it?

325
00:20:09.066 --> 00:20:12.500
- Fletchling! Fletch! Fletch!
- Pika! Pika!

326
00:20:13.466 --> 00:20:16.466
In the wake of Pikachu’s and Fletchling’s defeat at the hands

327
00:20:16.533 --> 00:20:18.533
of Viola’s Surskit and Vivillon,

328
00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:21.200
will Ash be able to come up with a strategy to defeat

329
00:20:21.266 --> 00:20:26.000
the Santalune City Gym Leader and win his first Kalos region Gym badge?

330
00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:34.000
- Ash? Here, use this.
- Ah? Huh?

331
00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:36.500
Great. Thanks.

332
00:20:36.566 --> 00:20:38.233
Hm.

333
00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.466
Mm, here we go.

334
00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:45.000
Ash, do you remember me?
